  "name": "FerroBRIDGEDftP11ToBundle",
  "title": "FerroBRIDGE supplement: DFT_P11 to Bundle",
  "status": "active",
  "experimental": true,
  "publisher": "Cadasto B.V. (FerroBRIDGE)",
  "description": "Adds a message map for the HL7 v2 DFT_P11 structure (P11, post detail financial transactions with expanded segments; http://hl7.org/v2/StructureDefinition/DFT_P11), for which hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0 ships none. The rows are those of ConceptMap/message-adt-a01-to-bundle for MSH, SFT, EVN, PID, PD1, PV1, PV2, DG1, IN1 and IN3 at their DFT_P11 paths (the visit under VISIT, DG1 under DIAGNOSIS), and those of ConceptMap/message-mdm-t02-to-bundle for the common order, ORC, TQ1, OBR and NTE, under COMMON_ORDER. The guide ships no segment map for FT1, GT1, DRG or ACC, so the financial transactions stay counted as unmapped. FerroBRIDGE #637.",
